description:
Faceabot's watch robots track standards (MCP, A2A, UCP, ACP), platforms (OpenAI, Google, Anthropic, Shopify), payments, paid placement in AI answers (ads), and which major stores let shopping agents in. Returns the latest items with links.
Use when: you need to know what changed recently before acting (new protocol version, a store that now blocks agents, a platform rule).
Example: {"topic":"standards","days":7}
